{
  "title": "Switch beta features on per site in Site Settings",
  "summary": "Experiments let a new feature run on staging before readers on the live site see it.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-18",
  "heroImage": {
    "$media": "hero.webp",
    "alt": "The Site Settings switch for the Ticker experiment, turned on"
  },
  "audience": ["admin"],
  "content": {
    "root": {
      "type": "root",
      "format": "",
      "indent": 0,
      "version": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Some new features arrive switched off. They're ",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "experiments",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 1,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": ": finished enough to try, but we want to see them working on staging before readers on the live site get them.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "type": "heading",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Where the switches are",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Open ",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Site Settings",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 1,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": " (under ",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "System",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 1,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": " in the admin's sidebar; only admins and chief editors see it). The ",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Experiments",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 1,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": " group has one checkbox per feature, with a line saying what it covers.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Each site keeps its own settings. Staging and the live site have separate databases, so ticking a box on staging changes nothing on the live site, and the reverse. Pull request previews start with staging's settings.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "type": "heading",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "What a switch does",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "When an experiment is off, readers can't reach the feature on that site at all: its pages return \"not found\", its links and buttons don't appear, and any background job it runs skips.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Saving Site Settings takes effect without a redeploy. Readers normally see the change on their next page load.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "type": "heading",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "When an experiment is done",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "mode": "normal",
              "text": "Once a feature has proved itself, its checkbox is removed in a later release and the feature is simply on.",
              "type": "text",
              "style": "",
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "textStyle": "",
          "textFormat": 0
        }
      ],
      "direction": null
    }
  }
}
